= Underfitting — Technical =

== Approximation and optimization ==
Poor training performance can reflect:

<pre>
approximation error
+ optimization error
+ representation/objective mismatch
</pre>

These causes should not be collapsed into one capacity explanation.

== Regularization ==
Regularization can improve generalization by constraining effective complexity.

Excessive regularization can instead increase systematic error and produce underfitting.

== Diagnostics ==
Learning curves can help distinguish data-limited, capacity-limited, and optimization-limited regimes, but interpretation depends on the task and metric.

